{"id": "EUVD-2026-104280", "enisaUuid": "218101f0-ddce-3fc8-b1a4-1902b859201d", "description": "BoxyHQ Enterprise SaaS Starter Kit through 1.6.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows non-owner team members to manage billing because payment routes skip the team_payments permission check. Authenticated MEMBER or ADMIN users can call create-portal-link, create-checkout-session, and products to open Stripe billing portals, view invoices, change payment methods, or alter subscriptions.", "datePublished": "2026-10-19T13:55:34", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T02:55:49", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/boxyhq/saas-starter-kit/issues/2511", "https://github.com/boxyhq/saas-starter-kit/blob/v1.6.0/pages/api/teams/%5Bslug%5D/payments/create-portal-link.ts", "https://github.com/boxyhq/saas-starter-kit/blob/v1.6.0/pages/api/teams/%5Bslug%5D/payments/create-checkout-session.ts", "https://github.com/boxyhq/saas-starter-kit/blob/v1.6.0/pages/api/teams/%5Bslug%5D/payments/products.ts", "https://github.com/boxyhq/saas-starter-kit/blob/v1.6.0/lib/permissions.ts", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/boxyhq-saas-starter-kit-through-1.6.0-missing-authorization-on-team-payment-api"], "aliases": ["GHSA-c4x3-mrrr-qp35", "CVE-2026-112293"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.18, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "f1beb333-8ccd-39d7-af36-c2826e6cb78d", "product": {"name": "saas-starter-kit", "vendor": {"name": "BoxyHQ"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.6.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "a6523752-60f8-34ba-8a42-22f74eb36487", "vendor": {"name": "BoxyHQ"}}], "isExploited": false}